Zioc
$cards
DECK 2 {SPADES, HEARTS, CLUBS, DIAMONDS}

$initial
DRAW 81 DEAL GUZOB
GUZOB 1 FACE_ALL
GUZOB 8 FACE_ALL
GUZOB 5 FACE_ALL
GUZOB 9 FACE_ALL

$moves
MOVE GUZOB GUZOB
AND
    OR
        DEST Rank 1
        DESTSRC Rank add_14
    SRC Rank K
MOVE_STACK GUZOB GUZOB
DEST Size > 1
$win
AND
    OR
        PILE ALL GUZOB Empty
        PILE ALL GUZOB Empty
    AND
        PILE ALL GUZOB Empty
        PILE ALL GUZOB Empty
